{"4064000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Testimony - Metal Graveyard", "steam_appid": 4064000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testimony is an episodic horror-thriller game anthology where each chapter tells a short story of people who have survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a testimony to tell, we’ll love you to share it with us in our official channels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.poster.avif?t=1760744834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.webm?t=1760744834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/04d238465f50cdfb6585b45ebfee9f01.mp4?t=1760744834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Testimony - Metal Graveyard</strong> <br>Mario, a college student in his early 20s, gets a call from a distant uncle asking him to take care of a junkyard in the middle of nowhere. As the days unfold, he’ll wish he had never gone there. Mario survived by making the right choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/57a6ba9598372d6f8c56fda6e14a3d2f.poster.avif?t=1760744834\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064000/extras/57a6ba9598372d6f8c56fda6e14a3d2f.webm?t=17607448